### Root Cause
- 2 DSVSAMSC POs (9785457207, 9385455174) exist in flask edi_po but NOT in wfashion
- These POs were never processed into soheader/sodetail in flask
- wfashion processed them fully, creating SO records + logs
- edi_po_sku_qty data is identical in both databases

### Report Generated
- File: edi850import.md (comprehensive comparison report)
- Contains: schema comparison, row counts, root cause analysis, recommendations

